<section class="reviews-section" id="reviews" style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 5.5rem 0; overflow: hidden;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-center">
      <span class="section-subtitle-pill">Verified Reviews</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Loved by Over 12,000+ Gift Givers</h2>
      <p>Continuous love stories from over 12,400+ gift-giving celebrations across the country.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Non-Stop Continuously Moving Testimonials Stream -->
  <div class="testimonials-marquee-wrapper">
    <div class="testimonials-marquee-track">
      <!-- Set 1 -->
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-text">&ldquo;I ordered 7 personalized leather lipstick keychains for my bridesmaids and they literally cried! The engraving of their birth flowers was so crisp, and the built-in mirror is super handy on nights out.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="reviewer-meta">
          <img src="{{ 'lookbook-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Emily R." class="reviewer-avatar">
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Emily R.</div>
            <div class="verified-pill">🌸 Verified Buyer &bull; Bridal Party</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-text">&ldquo;The LED compact mirror is stunning! It feels heavy and luxurious, not cheap at all. The light is bright enough for a quick touch-up in the car or a dimly lit restaurant. Packaging was like a luxury boutique gift.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="reviewer-meta">
          <img src="{{ 'lookbook-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Sophia M." class="reviewer-avatar">
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Sophia M.</div>
            <div class="verified-pill">🌸 Verified Buyer &bull; Birthday Gift</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-text">&ldquo;Bought the bear family wooden puzzle for my mother's 60th birthday with all 5 grandchildren's names etched. She has it on her living room mantel and shows everyone who visits. Incredible craftsmanship!&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="reviewer-meta">
          <img src="{{ 'lookbook-3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Jessica T." class="reviewer-avatar">
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Jessica T.</div>
            <div class="verified-pill">🌸 Verified Buyer &bull; Keepsake Decor</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-text">&ldquo;The velvet travel jewelry box is so plush! Kept all my rings and necklaces knot-free on my weekend getaway. The gold initial monogram looks so high-end!&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="reviewer-meta">
          <img src="{{ 'lookbook-4.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Chloe B." class="reviewer-avatar">
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Chloe B.</div>
            <div class="verified-pill">🌸 Verified Buyer &bull; Travel Jewelry Case</div>
